---
layout: base.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "By Category — Harness Census"
---
<h1>Entries by Category</h1>
<p>Audit buckets for the corpus: harnesses own a coding-agent loop, multiplexers run or coordinate other coding agents, tools support agents or developers without owning the loop, and something else covers related but out-of-scope discoveries.</p>

<section class="category-group">
  <h2>Harnesses ({{ collections.agent | size }})</h2>
  <table class="agent-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Name</th><th>Maker</th><th>Platform</th><th>Stars</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% set sorted = collections.agent | sortByStars %}
      {% for agent in sorted %}
      <tr>
        <td><a href="{{ ('/agents/' ~ agent.data.slug ~ '/') | url }}">{{ agent.data.name }}</a></td>
        <td>{{ agent.data.maker or "—" }}</td>
        <td>{{ agent.data.platforms | join(", ") }}</td>
        <td>{{ agent.data.stars | starFmt }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

